// Contexts.schema — the unit's build contexts (SPEC §4.2). User-declared, like
// everything else in this language — nothing pre-defined. A [local] field may
// scope itself with context = <name>; unscoped fields default to context = all.
// Generation emits a type per context where contexts diverge (ClientShipState,
// ServerShipState) — no preprocessor in any target.

package example

contexts { client, server }
